              "sourceContextAndLimits": "HH SekI p22 explicitly contains ethanol as an intoxicant; MV physical35/printed31 and physical37/printed33 require health dangers plus personal AND societal alcohol-misuse consequences and everyday uses. This whole bodily-effect/oxidative-pathway goal is a related own retained acquisition in the existing CrossStage GK/LK views. Its supplied physiology cases alone do not close the societal operator: the separate unchanged1df whole societal ethanol cases are included as context. No safe dose, wait time, personal diagnosis, real product approval, human performance or universal separate upper-course ethanol module follows.",
