      "operativeMaterialSelectionBoundary": "Current whole P requirements/transfer remain authoritative and unchanged. Whole original cases are retained as source material, not imported as fresh votes, point totals or obsolete universal AND/digital requirements. Where no separate material source is needed, the whole current brief itself includes the complete stimulus.",
