              },
              {
                "criterionKey": "sek1-model-use-criticism-particles-and-reaction-C2",
                "meaning": {
                  "de": "Materie-/Reaktionsaussagen und Atomerhaltung sind fachlich richtig.",
                  "en": "Matter/reaction statements and atom conservation are scientifically correct."
